{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>文章來源：Qooah.com</p><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23578231875582379293875.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"628\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6a93498f3cf7e4fe79dae3fe82d4c30824c4c37ae53a14eae10402d91f9fa73a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w1200%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2F17cc9842e5441502d7524e8f850e596a_up.jpg\" width=\"1200\"/></p></a><p>HONOR 香港宣佈於青衣及九龍灣新店正式開幕，兩間新店投入服務後，HONOR 在香港的體驗店總數量增至九間，進一步完善本地零售與售後服務網絡，讓新界西、九龍東一帶的消費者能夠就近走進門店，親身試用品牌全線智能手機、穿戴裝置及智能家居產品，了解 HONOR 圍繞 AI 技術搭建的終端生態。</p><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2378837562736829.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/04546eca3edc6977eec4d6feb44db22036ad96024084236baeaf218d2119a57d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w1200%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2F91d008796d5610e96a42325bafe533fe\" width=\"1200\"/></p></a><p>當中九龍灣德福店是 HONOR 在香港開設的第一間 Alpha Store，門店除了常規陳列 Magic9 Pro Max 等旗艦手機之外，特別劃出獨立 AI 產品展示區，內容覆蓋手機影像創作、流動辦公、智能家居以及健康管理等日常使用場景，同時設有第三方影音產品陳列區，透過模擬真實使用環境，向顧客示範 HONOR 創新科技如何融入居家與各個生活環節，消費者可以在店內實機操作，直接感受 AI 功能帶來的使用便利，而並非只能透過網頁規格了解產品表現。</p><p></p><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/78632678678932837962.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/704b455e06cdc3c831f1e55504a91e5281a8da1945e56b98e6a22bcddc17fe2a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w1200%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2F38f310c1cea08c4ec50379446c566d23\" width=\"1200\"/></p></a><p>配合兩間新店開幕，HONOR 於 11 月 25 日至 11 月 30 日一連六日推出「開幕多重賞」優惠活動，兩間新門店每日輪番上陣不同限量特惠商品，當中旗艦機型 HONOR Magic7 Pro 單機優惠價減去 HK$2,100；與此同時，HONOR 全線分店包括官方網上商店以及其餘線下門店，都會在同一優惠期間推出同步促銷，方便無法前往青衣或九龍灣門店的消費者選購。本次活動參與優惠的產品數量有限，貨品售完即止，各項折扣與贈品的適用條款，建議消費者臨到店時向門店人員查詢完整細節。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><p><strong>九龍灣HONOR Alpha Store體驗店「開幕多重賞」：</strong></p><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/437435263653456.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"396\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7d2d61d32df8d9dbd5dabc3a79727f0689c24749117b0950dca3ebc0a2b7bced/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w1200%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2F7195599e9acaed54c5862ce32372a851\" width=\"1200\"/></p></a><p><strong>青衣體驗店「開幕多重賞」：</strong></p><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/632445326325443735.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"292\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/084809ff78fa8a6944bfa0caefba2f390ac9a104fdd3d1e1957b42f1a7b20cb1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w1200%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2F2d84e93e1b26cf416f0bf098ac2ea786\" width=\"1200\"/></p></a><p><strong>全線體驗店（HONOR 網上商店及線下門店）優惠：</strong></p><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/6785876243678234.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"228\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b2a666384198e4d2a76a86f22dc38440148f7b97193361014f77c5e1692dfaf9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w1200%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2F91e652dfa8dd4e9eb01b8907e7dfd6e3\" width=\"1200\"/></p></a></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T12:24:02.569085+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":701,"images":6,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T09:00:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T14:17:38.543171+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T12:17:33.988921+00:00","content_hash":"0bffd28608edd29d8db18487898f92cbd04bb1dfa5634fdd686b2e47beb19c76","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}